A serene Buddhist monastery courtyard at golden hour, featuring a weathered stone Buddha statue in meditation pose, with a sleek black laptop placed at its base showing a glowing screen (no visible text or logos). Cherry blossom petals drift through the warm air. In the background, traditional curved temple rooftops contrast with subtle digital circuit board patterns etched into the ancient stone walls. A playful penguin sits peacefully beside the Buddha, both sharing the same tranquil expression. Soft orange and pink sunset light filters through bamboo groves, casting long peaceful shadows. Style: Marc Chagall - dreamlike floating elements, rich jewel-toned colors of deep blues, warm oranges and soft pinks, whimsical perspective where gravity seems optional, folk art influences blending the sacred and technological in harmonious coexistence.
